  "post_title": "El Molí de la Reixa de Onda acoge una exposición sobre la fiesta de San Antonio",
  "post_date": "2012-01-20 07:15:41",
  "post_name": "el-moli-de-la-reixa-de-onda-acoge-una-exposicion-sobre-la-fiesta-de-san-antonio",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>El Mol&iacute; de la Reixa de Onda acoge desde anoche hasta el pr&oacute;ximo 29 de enero la exposici&oacute;n &quot;La festa de Sant Antoni, Homenatge als nostres majors i Col&middot;lecci&oacute; de Talles de Fusta de Teodoro L&oacute;pez&quot;.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/01/IMG_7429.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La muestra, que estar&aacute; abierta de 10 a 13.30 horas de lunes a domingo y de 16 a 18 horas de mi&eacute;rcoles a viernes,&nbsp;fue inaugurada anoche por la teniente de alcalde de Cultura, Mar&iacute;a Dolores Feliu. El concejal de Fiestas, Leonardo Molina, agradeci&oacute; la colaboraci&oacute;n de todas las personas que han colaborado en el montaje de la exposici&oacute;n: Teodoro L&oacute;pez, Vicente Garc&iacute;a, Pepe Catal&aacute;n, Pepe Castell&oacute;, familiares de Pepe March, Antonio Ta&uacute;s, Salvador Piquer, J. Llorens Mundina, Vicente &quot;El Rero&quot;, Salvador Mart&iacute;nez &quot;El Borino&quot;, Javier Collado, Juan Lizondo, Antonio Garc&iacute;a, de l&#39;Agrupaci&oacute; Fotogr&agrave;fica L&#39;Art de la Llum, y Migue Garc&iacute;a Tamayo, de TamayoImatge.</p>\n<p>El alcalde, Salvador Aguilella, y la reina de la Fira 2011, Chari Aguilella Ribes, entregaron una placa conmenorativa a Vicente Garc&iacute;a, por su desinteresada colaboraci&oacute;n con la fiesta de San Antonio durante su larga vida. Al final &eacute;ste pos&oacute; junto a Pepe Catal&aacute;n y su esposa.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/exposantantonimolireixa/img_7426.jpg\" alt=\"img_7426\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/exposantantonimolireixa/img_7427.jpg\" alt=\"img_7427\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/exposantantonimolireixa/img_7428.jpg\" alt=\"img_7428\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/exposantantonimolireixa/img_7429.jpg\" alt=\"img_7429\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/exposantantonimolireixa/img_7430.jpg\" alt=\"img_7430\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/exposantantonimolireixa/img_7431.jpg\" alt=\"img_7431\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/exposantantonimolireixa/img_7432.jpg\" alt=\"img_7432\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/exposantantonimolireixa/img_7433.jpg\" alt=\"img_7433\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/exposantantonimolireixa/img_7434.jpg\" alt=\"img_7434\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/exposantantonimolireixa/img_7435.jpg\" alt=\"img_7435\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/exposantantonimolireixa/img_7436.jpg\" alt=\"img_7436\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/exposantantonimolireixa/img_7437.jpg\" alt=\"img_7437\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/exposantantonimolireixa/img_7438.jpg\" alt=\"img_7438\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/exposantantonimolireixa/img_7439.jpg\" alt=\"img_7439\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/exposantantonimolireixa/img_7440.jpg\" alt=\"img_7440\" style=\"max-width:100%;height